Z||000000||Cooter||12-12-2001||08:53 PM||||I have been in touch with a nationally recognized automobile print artist. His work is very high quality at a reasonable price (usually less than $50 for them). He has looked at some of our cars and agrees that they are worthy of being represented in his artwork, but will not commit unless he can be assured that at least 500 prints can be sold. Instead of bombarding him with phone calls, I told him that I would post a message here and print it out after it dies down and send it to him. So, do we want a large lithograph Fiero print? If you are interested, please just reply to this thread with the number of prints that you would like to buy- no commitment, just an improvised, non-scientific vote.<BR>Cooter wants 2- anyone else?<p>[This message has been edited by Cooter (edited 12-12-2001).]||||reg||1
