Z||000011||MinnGreenGT||12-12-2001||11:21 PM||||$50?  With a minimum of 500 prints? I'd assume that it is of only one car...!<P>I have another offer.  I was going to save this until I had the company  website finished, but I recently started a new wide-format printing company.  <A HREF="http://www.romatekgraphics.com" TARGET=_blank>Romatek Graphics, Inc.</A> and we are kinda hurting for business (with the newly reduced economy).<P>We have an 8-color (offset is usually only 4 color) wide format machine capable of printing up to 4' wide (technically 5ft, but media is expensive at that size) by any length.  A standard 2'x3' poster would retail for $105... I would offer them for $50, shipped in the continental US to PFF members.  8-color print, on 7mil photo paper. Can easily be put into a poster frame.  Will laminate print for an additional $10.<P>I would need a high resolution scanned photo of your car (or a GOOD 4x6 or 5x7- or larger print to be scanned by me).  Typical turnaround would be approximately one week.<P>I also have the ability to produce small tradeshow/pop style displays (see photo below).  Anyone who saw me & the GreenGT at Fierorama this past summer- probably saw the display.  I can offer the 2'x3' display printed w/frame for $150 to PFF members.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/greendisplay1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/greendisplay2.jpg"> <P>Let me know what you guys think! <P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000012||Cooter||12-13-2001||10:04 PM||||Be careful when you assume because you are not going to make one out of me on this one. This is a one of the $50 prints:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sample.jpg"> <BR>I took a picture of the catalog page, so it does not do it any justice. ||||reg||1
Z||000013||MinnGreenGT||12-14-2001||10:00 AM||||OK... didn't mean anything negative by it- just offering a different option.  I'm sorry to say that a run of 500 prints might be tough to come by (you know- Fiero owners are known to be "cheap" sometimes  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">).  Check to see what he'd want to charge for a lower number run.  I can also produce arwork prints (Giclee'-pronounced:"ja-clay"), on canvas & other art materials, in short numbers for budget art runs.  Anyway- If you are taking numbers... you can count me in. I'd still buy one.  Like I said- I was just offering another option.||||reg||1
