Z||000022||MinnGreenGT||12-21-2001||10:37 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Mickey_Moose:<BR><B>Well personally I think that if something was going to be made up - all the models should be represented (Indy, pointed nose, aero, gt, mera, formula, etc) - that way everyone is covered...there should be enough models to cover all the colors as well   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, there are a few options from here.  I'm working on a small sample poster (using LT1 ChopTop's pic/car).  I ran a test print last night, but found a few errors in my photoshop editing (moved one layer, but not 2 others that should've moved with it).  The first poster(s) will probably be of just individual people's cars.  If the opportunity arises (or if we can coordinate it) A group pic could be taken someplace (like a dealership or Porkey's or something) that could contain all the cars.  This might be something to be done at a regional or national event.  In the mean time, I'll post again later with a "proof" image of LT1 ChopTop's demo poster (btw- currnent size on that poster is about 24" wide by 12" tall).<P>This is the style I'm starting with<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/f355poster.jpg"> <BR><FONT SIZE="1">this poster currently available at <A HREF="http://www.allwall.com" TARGET=_blank>AllWall.com</A></FONT>||||reg||1
