Z||000025||Gold-86SE||12-21-2001||01:07 PM||||<BR>I find the idea of a print cool and would be willing to buy one, I need something awesome for my living room wall.<P>Yet, I agree with most of the posts, it will be difficult for all of us to agree on a particular version of the Fiero.<P>Someone mentioned a print that would "cover all the bases" meaning as many years and versions of the Fiero would be included in the print as possible.<P>The example print given with the cars in front of the Chevy dealership is the kind of idea I think will work, but change the backdrop from a dealership to something more lively.  Like a group of Fieros showing their stuff in front of a neat looking burger joint (the kind of burger joint that hot rodders gather). IOW, a place that shows the spirit of the Fiero, a dealership does not show the Fiero spirit.<BR><P>------------------<BR>84 SE 4.10 4 Speed (Not So Fair Weather Driver)<BR>84 SE Automatic (Parts Car)<BR>85 GT Automatic (Restoration Project)<BR>86 SE 4 Speed   (Fair Weather Daily Driver)<BR>87 SC 5 Speed   (Parts Car)||||reg||1
Z||000026||MinnGreenGT||12-21-2001||01:27 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Gold-86SE:<BR><B>The example print given with the cars in front of the Chevy dealership is the kind of idea I think will work, but change the backdrop from a dealership to something more lively.  Like a group of Fieros showing their stuff in front of a neat looking burger joint (the kind of burger joint that hot rodders gather). IOW, a place that shows the spirit of the Fiero, a dealership does not show the Fiero spirit.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, that's what I was suggesting when I mentioned a place like Porkey's (It's actually a historical landmark here in Minnesota).  Check it out here: <A HREF="http://www.ktca.org/lostcity/porkys.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ktca.org/lostcity/porkys.html</A> <P>Think in these styles:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cruisers.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/roadside.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/route66.jpg"> <P>If no one else can come up with a good setup, next spring/summer maybe I'll try to organize a setup like this and shoot some film!||||reg||1
