Z||000030||chester||12-23-2001||08:29 AM||||Hi everyone,<P>For those that just want a large print of your car you can send a high resolution image via e-mail to a company called zip marketing ( <A HREF="http://www.zipmarketing.com" TARGET=_blank>www.zipmarketing.com</A>  ) and they can make you a print to whatever size you want.  I had this poster done about a year and a half ago and it has held up well. They will use UV resistant dyes if you so request. Just an FYI for those of you who want a one off of their car.  Ordering was painless and the poster was mailed to me by second day air!<P>Rob D.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/poster.JPG">  <P>Think its time to update my poster  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by chester (edited 12-23-2001).]||||reg||1
